# Working notes for whatever is being built right now: plans, audits, review
# findings, loop/iteration logs, progress reports. These are session state, not
# documentation -- they describe a moment, nothing reads them, and once committed
# they rot in place and mislead. Keep them here; promote anything durable into an
# ADR (a decision), doc/ prose (a fact), or TODO (an open task). See CLAUDE.md.
.scratch/
